  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Jesus Children Of America** (1 other source): Jesus Children is split in two: the band segues into Who Knows, then returns to Jesus Children afterward [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Neal Interlude**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Somewhere Over The Rainbow**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Evidence**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2000-08-12.shnf** (recommended): source not stated; 10 songs; 128 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2000-08-12.shnf**: taped by Pat Kelly; transferred by Pat Kelly; source: Oktava Mc012(hyper card)>Sound Devices Mp2>Sony D-10 Pro [1]",
